# CI/CD - {{ project_name }}

## Overview

All CI/CD runs on **GitHub Actions** with **path-based triggers** - each platform's workflow only runs when its files change.

## Workflows

| Workflow | Trigger Paths | What It Does |
|----------|--------------|--------------|
{% if "backend" in platforms %}| `backend.yml` | `backend/**`, `shared/**` | Gradle test + build, Docker push to Azure ACR, deploy to Container Apps |
{% endif %}{% if "web-user-app" in platforms %}| `web-user-app.yml` | `web-user-app/**`, `shared/**` | npm lint + typecheck + `next build` + OpenNext bundle + `wrangler deploy --dry-run`, then deploy to Cloudflare Workers on `main` |
{% endif %}{% if "web-admin-portal" in platforms %}| `web-admin-portal.yml` | `web-admin-portal/**`, `shared/**` | npm lint + typecheck + `next build` + OpenNext bundle + `wrangler deploy --dry-run`, then deploy to Cloudflare Workers on `main` |
{% endif %}{% if "mobile-android" in platforms %}| `mobile-android.yml` | `mobile-android/**`, `shared/**` | Gradle test + assembleDebug, Fastlane deploy on tags |
{% endif %}{% if "mobile-ios" in platforms %}| `mobile-ios.yml` | `mobile-ios/**`, `shared/**` | xcodebuild test (macOS runner), Fastlane deploy on tags |
{% endif %}| `api-contracts.yml` | `shared/api-contracts/**` | Validate OpenAPI spec |

## Required GitHub Secrets

{% if "backend" in platforms %}
### Azure
| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `AZURE_CREDENTIALS` | Service principal JSON |
| `AZURE_CONTAINER_REGISTRY` | ACR login server |
| `AZURE_CONTAINER_APP_NAME` | Container App name |
| `AZURE_RESOURCE_GROUP` | Resource group |
| `ACR_USERNAME` | Registry username used to push the backend image |
| `ACR_PASSWORD` | Registry password used to push the backend image |
{% endif %}

{% if "web-user-app" in platforms or "web-admin-portal" in platforms %}
### Cloudflare
| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID` | Account ID |
| `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` | API token with Workers edit permissions |
{% endif %}

{% if "mobile-android" in platforms %}
### Android
| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `ANDROID_KEYSTORE_BASE64` | Signing keystore (base64) |
| `ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD` | Keystore password |
| `ANDROID_KEY_ALIAS` | Key alias |
| `ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD` | Key password |
| `GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON` | Play Console service account |
{% endif %}

{% if "mobile-ios" in platforms %}
### iOS
| Secret | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `ASC_KEY_ID` | App Store Connect API key ID |
| `ASC_ISSUER_ID` | App Store Connect issuer ID |
| `ASC_KEY_CONTENT` | App Store Connect API key content (base64) |
| `MATCH_PASSWORD` | Fastlane match encryption password |
| `MATCH_GIT_URL` | Git URL of the Fastlane match certificate repository |
{% endif %}

## Skipped Deploys

A release job needs every secret listed for its platform. When one is missing, the job does not deploy. It reports **Deploy skipped** as a workflow warning and in the job summary, names the secrets to set, and still succeeds.{% if "backend" in platforms %} The backend image push reports **Image push skipped** the same way, and the backend deploy job does not run after it.{% endif %}
{% if "mobile-ios" in platforms %}
The iOS CI jobs create `mobile-ios/Config/Debug.xcconfig` and `Release.xcconfig` from the tracked `.example` files. Set the production API URL in `Release.xcconfig.example` before tagging a release.
{% endif %}
